message: "If you use Cross-Runtime Inference Tester in research or teaching, please cite this software."
title: "Cross-Runtime Inference Tester"
version: 0.1.0
authors:
  - family-names: Rana
    given-names: Jahanzaib
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0006-7085-0440"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ranajahanzaib/cross-runtime-inference-tester"
license: MIT
abstract: "Cross-Runtime Inference Tester measures whether a numerical ONNX model produces equivalent outputs in Python ONNX Runtime and browser ONNX Runtime Web. It reports numerical drift, class agreement, artifact identity, and measured runtime latency."
keywords:
  - machine-learning
  - onnx
  - onnxruntime
  - webassembly
  - model-verification
